      "text": "29 December – Corcovado, Christ the Redeemer, and Tijuca Forest"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:569e72e117968fcc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "c019dd504927e417274bf866529e9f3ece40fbce0ab1906456755fff24b10376",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw6m9eqf-foeqbfym4pcbiij9z51xa",
        "model": "GPT-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, set out on a four-hour tour of Corcovado and Christ the Redeemer with an English-speaking guide.\n\nThe road to the summit runs through the rainforest of Tijuca Forest. At 710 m above sea level stands the 38 m statue of Christ the Redeemer, erected in 1931. The viewing platform offers panoramic views of Rio, including Guanabara Bay, the bridge to Niterói, the Botanical Garden, Maracanã Stadium, Sugarloaf Mountain, and other parts of the city.\n\nReturn to the hotel after the tour."
    },
